            </div>
        </div>

     <div style="background-color: #2d3436; color: #bdc3c7; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; border-top: 4px solid #1a128c;">
    <div style="max-width: 550px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Dyson GmbH</p>
